    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "WrgTi",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Note Motion contract",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Motion contract\n\nEasing: cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), slow (600–1200ms). Respect prefers-reduced-motion: keep fades only.\n• Hero: headline fades up 24px; grid lines draw in. The whale is a static drawing — no animation.\n• Section enter: hairline strokes draw themselves (stroke-dashoffset 1→0, 900ms).\n• Compare: checkmarks pop in one by one (scale .6→1, 60ms stagger).\n• Networks: chip outlines draw in sequence (80ms stagger); logos bob 3px, offset per chip.\n• Hosts/Contribute: logos and icons float 6px on staggered 5s loops; hover thickens outline to 1.5px."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "JjH7X",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 340,
      "name": "Note Placeholders to fill",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Still to verify\n\n• Compare cells come from public docs as of Nov 18, 2026 (metamask.com/agent-wallet, docs.phantom.com, paybox.sh/llms.txt). Phantom docs were unreachable; Phantom cells rely on search summaries + npm readme mentions.\n• Hermes has no Whale manifest in the repo yet; marked 'planned'.\n• Logos: hosts from @lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.71.0, chains from DefiLlama icons + cryptocurrency-icons 0.18.1, saved in ./logos. Check each brand's usage guidelines before launch.\n• Contributor avatars are placeholder circles."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "hB85k",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 680,
      "name": "Note Accessibility contract",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Accessibility contract\n\n• Body #5C5C5C on #FFFFFF ≈ 6.7:1; ink on white ≈ 19:1. Pastels are never used for text.\n• Buttons are 52px tall (44px in the nav); mobile menu button 44×44.\n• Focus: 2px lavender ring with 3px offset on every link, card, tab and button.\n• Compare table: role=table; ✓ cells carry aria-label 'Yes', '—' cells 'No / unknown'.\n• Status badges (send disabled, opt-in) use text, not color alone.\n• Install tabs: role=tablist, arrow keys move between tabs."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "EZfoz",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 1020,
      "name": "Note Section map",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "Section map\n\nLanding: desktop x=0 (1440), mobile x=1640 (390), 9 section frames each, stacked flush.\nDocs: x=2700 — Docs / Nav + Docs / Install + Comparison (chapter 1 Install, chapter 2 Comparison).\nComponents (incl. InstallBlock) and the WhaleSketch master sit above / left of the origin."
    },
